; Quick iterative sync-test boot: replace the original driver but do not run
; the full asynchronous baseline. Run S:sync-test, then S:sync-write-test.
FailAt 21
MakeDir RAM:T
Assign T: RAM:T
Echo "Loading mastercard.device without the full baseline test."
Echo "Don't use the hard disk until you reboot."
MCDiag TAKEOVER LOADONLY
Echo "Ready: Execute S:sync-test"
